        "C": "15",
        "D": "14"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "3M = 4W. 7M + 5W = 7(4/3)W + 5W = 43/3 W. 4W take 43 days, so 43/3 W take (4 * 43) / (43/3) = 12 days.",
      "hash": "4932e1110fbe6a92",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि 3 पुरुष या 4 महिलाएं एक कार्य को 43 दिनों में कर सकते हैं, तो 7 पुरुष और 5 महिलाएं कितने दिन लेंगे?",
          "options": {
            "A": "12",
            "B": "10",
            "C": "15",
            "D": "14"
          },
          "explanation": "3M = 4W. 7M + 5W = 43/3 W. दिन = 12."
        }
      }
    }
